  "description": "Fun and learning come together with the World of Eric Carle Wobble and Wiggle Bead Mazy by KidKraft.  #countingbeads #learningtoys\n\nAdd fun and learning to playtime today:\nhttps://www.kidkraft.com/us_en/world-of-eric-carle-tm-wobble-and-wiggle-bead-maze-10052.html\n\nThis colorful bead maze is built on a wobbly base for surprising motion when baby touches it. Follow the caterpillar's journey through metaporphoses as he eats, makes a cocoon and transforms into a butterly. This bead maze is where fun and coordination development come together!\n\nSUBSCRIBE for more awesome toy reviews, play kitchen reveals, and unboxing videos ► http://bit.ly/1XhM6Wa \n\nPlaylist made for growing little minds:\nWooden Toys & Play Sets | KidKraft\nhttps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLvw3WiRWyISzyBdd8NEH3GkYCjWMDtax4 \n\nFOLLOW US ON SOCIAL\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/kidkrafttoys\nPinterest:  https://www.pinterest.com/kidkraft",
